{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This is the free demo version of <i>Swing Swamp</i>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo provides the early stages of the full game, showcasing the main thrill of the game \u2014 defeating enemies while swinging! Additionally included:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Obtain weapons and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collectibles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Game feature</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Environment</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to this overlooked wetland, where peculiar ecosystems and unique landscapes thrive. But beware \u2013 this realm has its own rules!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443860/extras/Environment.gif?t=1740661096\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Movement</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> </strong>jump, grapple, swing, glide... Your movement is full of possibilities. Attack your enemies in unexpected ways. But don't fall into the water \u2013 there might be other dangers lurking...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443860/extras/Movement.gif?t=1740661096\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Weapon</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enhance your arsenal to combat escalating threats! Keep an eye out for those aspergillus flavus \u2013 destroying them will charge your weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443860/extras/Weapon.gif?t=1740661096\" /></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/ima